# Operator Tool Selection

When applying a Controlled Rupture Operator, select tools (read_file, grep, codebase_search, search_replace, write, todo_write, etc.) according to the operator.

Use the **operator-tools** skill for per-operator tool lists and mode-aware guidance. See `.cursor/skills/operator-tools/SKILL.md`.
